{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your spaceship crash-landed in some kind of alien jungle, and you barely made it out using your escape pod. Now, you'll have to cross the jungle to find a city where you can hopefully launch yourself back into space and find your way home again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guided by your escape pod AI, you'll traverse 33 unique levels and face 3 epic bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a block breaker you can play alone or with a friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player or 2-player local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different episode with a total of 33 levels and 3 boss fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An engaging story that has absolutely nothing more to it. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're definitely not helping an alien fleet conquer and enslave the galaxy.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2789390?t=1742233496","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/1e260b2ff108745b69558d07d3d6a83a99cae60c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742233496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/cf8ed463b892118b352f1b475dc898aed635e233/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742233496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789390/cf8ed463b892118b352f1b475dc898aed635e233/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742233496","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph